# AI Backend

Read-only AI orchestration service for the School ERP.

**Why it exists:** [ADR-0002](../docs/adr/0002-ai-backend-orchestration-service.md)  
**Decisions:** [ai-backend-v1](../docs/decisions/ai-backend-v1.md)  
**Run:** [docs/runbook.md](./docs/runbook.md)

## Responsibilities (V1)

- Chat orchestration (LangGraph — later milestones)
- Tool selection / execution against ERP HTTP API
- Conversation memory in Redis
- LLM calls via OpenAI-compatible HTTP

## Non-responsibilities

- ERP business rules, database access, JWT minting/verification with shared secret

## Layout (Clean Architecture)

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `app/` | FastAPI delivery (routes, middleware) |
| `domain/` | Models + ports (`LLMClient`, `ErpClient`, `ConversationStore`, `Clock`) |
| `infrastructure/` | Config, logging, **fakes** (M2); real adapters in M3+ |

See [`domain/README.md`](./domain/README.md).

## Current milestone

**M3** — Redis `ConversationStore` (M4 ERP client already landed).
